        "description": "One solid rising, flattening curve from the visible lower-left endpoint to the upper-right endpoint, with no interior reversal or separate plotted point markers. The bounded endpoints are retained at their observed grid intersections. Short connected source-pixel spans are a modern tracing regularization, not an exact function formula. The queried half-unit level is read against the source lattice before tracing; it is not drawn as a new guide or annotated answer. Raster thickness/skew leaves roughly 0.1 unit uncertainty between cells; no unprinted interior value is silently snapped to an integer or half-integer.",
